BT /F1 13 Tf 72 750 Td 15 TL (1. Detection - resnet18 model, fixed preprocessing, species vocabulary and confidence threshold) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 728 Td 12 TL
(The classifier is the resnet18 model with weights resnet18.a1_in1k, loaded from the) Tj T*
(torchvision weights. Every frame is preprocessed identically and deterministically before it) Tj T*
(reaches the model.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Preprocessing is: resize the image to input size 224 by 224 using bicubic interpolation;) Tj T*
(convert to a tensor; normalize each channel with mean \(0.485, 0.456, 0.406\) and standard) Tj T*
(deviation \(0.229, 0.224, 0.225\) in red, green, blue order; then apply a center crop scaled) Tj T*
(by 0.95. The crop scale 0.95 is applied to the 224 size. No other transform, augmentation,) Tj T*
(or flipping is used.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Species vocabulary is exactly six ImageNet indices, and the species name is the ImageNet) Tj T*
(class name: 386 elephant, 69 trilobite, 117 nautilus, 401 accordion, 355 llama, 334) Tj T*
(hedgehog. Only these six labels are counted. A frame whose top-1 class is any index outside) Tj T*
(this set is not a target detection and contributes nothing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Confidence threshold is 0.65. The softmax probability of the top-1 class must be greater) Tj T*
(than or equal to 0.65 for the frame to count. A detection below 0.65 counts as not detected:) Tj T*
(it adds nothing to any species count and nothing to the site total.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Blank or vegetation frames are excluded by this threshold and never counted as a species.) Tj T*
(Their top-1 confidences are about 0.01 to 0.21, far below 0.65, so they fail the threshold) Tj T*
(like any other non-target frame. There is no separate blank detector and no blank class in) Tj T*
(the vocabulary.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Each counted frame contributes exactly one count to its top-1 species, and only if that) Tj T*
(species is in the six-label vocabulary and its confidence is at least 0.65.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
