BT /F1 13 Tf 72 750 Td 15 TL (2. Per-site aggregation and diversity estimators) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 728 Td 12 TL
(Aggregation is per site. Let n be the number of counted detections at the site, meaning) Tj T*
(frames that passed both the vocabulary and threshold rules. Let S be the number of distinct) Tj T*
(vocabulary species counted at that site, and let count_i be the count for species i. Each) Tj T*
(relative abundance is p_i = count_i / n.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Shannon index H = -sum\(p_i * ln\(p_i\)\), summed over the counted species, using the natural) Tj T*
(logarithm. This is the Shannon entropy of the site species distribution.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Simpson index D = 1 - sum\(p_i^2\), summed over the counted species. This is the Gini-Simpson) Tj T*
(form, one minus the sum of squared relative abundances. The inverse Simpson form is not) Tj T*
(used.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Chao richness estimator, bias-corrected form: Chao = S + f1*\(f1-1\) / \(2*\(f2+1\)\), where f1 is) Tj T*
(the number of species with count exactly 1 at that site and f2 is the number of species with) Tj T*
(count exactly 2 at that site. The classic Chao form S + f1^2/\(2*f2\) is not used here.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(All four quantities are reported per site and only per site: n, S, H, D, and Chao. Counts n,) Tj T*
(S, f1, and f2 are integers. H, D, and Chao are reported rounded half up to four decimals.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
