BT /F1 13 Tf 72 750 Td 15 TL (3. Degenerate handling and rounding) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 728 Td 12 TL
(If n = 0, meaning no counted detections at the site, then S = 0, H = 0, D = 0, and Chao = 0.) Tj T*
(No formula is evaluated on empty data.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If n > 0, then S is at least 1 and the formulas in Section 2 apply directly to the observed) Tj T*
(counts. Species with zero count at the site do not appear in any sum and do not add to S,) Tj T*
(f1, or f2.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Rounding is half up to four decimal places for H, D, and Chao. Counts are integers and are) Tj T*
(never rounded. Lower-confidence or off-vocabulary frames never enter n, so they never change) Tj T*
(any of these values.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
